            "name": "Add Item to Wishlist",
            "description": {
              "content": "The Add Item to Wishlist endpoint adds a variant to an existing wishlist by creating a new `wished_item`. A wished item in a wishlist is comparable to a line item in a cart.\n\nEach wished item references a single variant, holds the desired quantity and returns price information determined by the variant price in current currency, and desired quantity.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
